<h3><span class="mw-headline" id="Usage">Usage</span></h3>
<div class="dascript" style="font-family:monospace; background-color:#F9F9F9; border: 1px dashed #2F6FAB; white-space:pre; line-height:1.25em; padding:1.0em;"><span style="color: #0000FF;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Case%20keyword" title="Case keyword (page does not exist)">case</a></span> EVENT_TYPE_COMBAT_END:<br />{<br /><br />    <span style="color:#007F00; font-style:italic;">// insert event-handling code here</span><br /><br />    <span style="color:#0000FF;"><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Break%20keyword" title="Break keyword (page does not exist)">break</a></span>;<br />}</div><a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Creature%20core" title="Creature core (page does not exist)">creature_core</a> handles this event. It checks if the creature is set to surrender (local int SURR_SURRENDER_ENABLED) and initiates dialogue if it is. It then uses the <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Rubber%20GoHome" title="Rubber GoHome (page does not exist)">Rubber_GoHome</a> function to send the creature back to its home location.
